AuthController.cs:

POST /api/v1/auth/login (Validates primary password and issues pre_auth_token)

POST /api/v1/auth/mfa/verify (Validates TOTP or backup code and issues session JWT)

MfaAdminController.cs:

POST /api/v1/admin/users/{userId}/mfa/reset (Allows admins to revoke a user's 2FA profile)
